WEBVTT

00:37:28.681 --> 00:37:30.266
but no longer do,

00:37:30.290 --> 00:37:33.326
like celebrating a holiday
with your extended family,

00:37:33.350 --> 00:37:34.966
going on vacation,

00:37:34.990 --> 00:37:36.436
even going to a restaurant.

00:37:37.310 --> 00:37:40.376
Reminiscing about those moments
might seem bittersweet,

00:37:40.400 --> 00:37:43.196
but the aftertaste is mostly sweet.

00:37:43.220 --> 00:37:45.547
It motivates you
to make the most of the present.

00:37:46.320 --> 00:37:49.766
But it doesn't just help to remember
pleasant memories from the past.

00:37:49.790 --> 00:37:52.936
There are also benefits
to reflecting on painful ones, too.

00:37:52.960 --> 00:37:59.680
SK: It was the worst day
of my 520 days in space by far